(slower-x8-sv03-racetrack-altitude-turns-pseudo-6dof)
*title Skywalker X8 powered racetrack kinematic 3-plus-3 realization
*mode kinematic-6dof
*atmos standard
*earth wgs-84 omega=0.0
*units/fmt alt m f.3
*units/fmt vel m/sec f.3
*units/fmt mass kg f.3
*units/fmt long deg f.3
*units/fmt lat deg f.3
*units/fmt gama deg f.3
*units/fmt psi deg f.3
*runtime status vehicle reference-area=0.75 reference-length=0.36 dry-mass-kg=3.364 nominal-mass-kg=3.364 inertia-x=0.325 inertia-y=0.14 inertia-z=0.4 envelope-min-forward-speed=2 envelope-max-speed=27 envelope-max-alpha-deg=12 envelope-max-beta-deg=5 aero-alpha-reference-deg=7.8095001441
*runtime status attitude mode=lag roll-deg=0 pitch-deg=0 yaw-deg=90 response-profile-id=skywalker_x8.attitude_response_p6dof.v1 response-law=first-order-rate-limited-v1 lag-s=0.5 max-rate-deg-s=180
*runtime control throttle vehicle=1 default=0.5773431905510489 lower=0 upper=1
*runtime control collective-elevon-deg vehicle=1 default=-2.147887654393667 lower=-20 upper=20
*runtime control differential-elevon-deg vehicle=1 default=-3.9378035933567617 lower=-20 upper=20
*runtime status target latitude-deg=0.0 longitude-deg=0.0 altitude-m=178.0
*runtime status route mode=racetrack start-latitude-deg=0.0 start-longitude-deg=0.0 duration-s=183.2779720200302 racetrack-length-m=1000 racetrack-turn-radius-m=203.8258680187507 racetrack-speed-mps=17.9 racetrack-low-altitude-m=178 racetrack-high-altitude-m=188 racetrack-climb-rate-mps=0.5 racetrack-descent-rate-mps=0.3 racetrack-left-bank-deg=-10 racetrack-right-bank-deg=10 racetrack-coordinated-turn=false racetrack-altitude-capture-gain-per-s=0 racetrack-altitude-capture-max-mps=0 position-capture-gain=0 position-capture-max-correction-mps=0
*trajectory 1 x8 start on 1
  *initial geodetic alt=178.0 long=0.0 lat=0.0 vel=17.9 gama=0.0 psi=90.0 time=0.0 mass=3.364
  *segment 1 racetrack-altitude-turns
    *integ dtprnt=1.0 dt=0.05
    *fly alpha=7.8095001441
    *aero cx=(cx-static) cy=(cy-static) cz=(cz-static) sref=0.75
    *prop thrust=(thrust) mdot=0
    *when time>203.27797202003 stop
*end
